OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners' 'pride' as court
OL,4,Aoverturns decision to block NI's
OL,5,Alargest road project
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Court of Appeal in Belfast
OL,8,Foverturns a decision to block work on
OL,9,Fone of Northern Ireland's largest ever
OL,10,Froad projects, the A5
OL,12,FThe 58-mile (94km) #1.7bn project -
OL,13,Fwhich runs from Londonderry to
OL,14,FAughnacloy in County Tyrone - has been
OL,15,Fin the works for 20 years but has been
OL,16,Fheld up by delays and legal challenges
OL,18,FLady Chief Justice Siobhan Keegan ruled
OL,19,Fin favour of the Department for
OL,20,FInfrastructure, which challenged a
OL,21,Fruling last year that stopped work on
OL,22,Fthe project going forward
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/4
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
