OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners' 'pride' as court
OL,4,Aoverturns decision to block NI's
OL,5,Alargest road project
OL,6,
OL,7,FDescribing the legal history of the
OL,8,Fproject as "long and torturous", she
OL,9,Fruled on four main grounds including
OL,10,Fhuman rights and climate change
OL,12,FLady Justice Keegan said the ruling
OL,13,Fthat the plans breached human rights
OL,14,Fshould be reversed and also that the
OL,15,Fplans should proceed despite how it
OL,16,Fintersects with the Climate Change Act
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/4
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
