OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners' 'pride' as court
OL,4,Aoverturns decision to block NI's
OL,5,Alargest road project
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 50 people have died on the A5
OL,8,Fsince 2006 and campaigners have long
OL,9,Fcalled for the road to be upgraded
